    "type": "Quote of the Week",
    "quote": "Life really does begin at 40. Up until then you are just doing research.",
    "author": "Carl Gustav Jung (26 July 1875 - 6 June 1961) - Swiss psychiatrist, psychotherapist, and psychologist."
